Ctype: character type checks (ctype_digit, ctype_alpha, ...) by the
current locale.

The module ctype of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20190902/ctype.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its
headers in include/php74/php/ext/ctype.
